1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:04,383
Cleopatra. Ancient Egypt. The pyramid days.

2
00:00:04,533 --> 00:00:07,250
Except... not even close.

3
00:00:07,400 --> 00:00:09,950
The Cleopatra timeline.

4
00:00:10,100 --> 00:00:14,817
The Great Pyramid: around 2560 BC.

5
00:00:14,967 --> 00:00:18,383
Cleopatra died in 30 BC.

6
00:00:18,533 --> 00:00:21,817
That's over 2,500 years later.

7
00:00:21,967 --> 00:00:25,250
The pyramids were already ancient to her.

8
00:00:25,400 --> 00:00:29,183
Now, the Moon landing. 1969.

9
00:00:29,333 --> 00:00:34,350
From Cleopatra to the Moon landing: about 2,000 years.

10
00:00:34,500 --> 00:00:37,550
So she lived closer to the Moon landing...

11
00:00:37,700 --> 00:00:40,917
...than to the building of the Great Pyramid.

12
00:00:41,067 --> 00:00:43,917
Also, her family was Greek.

13
00:00:44,067 --> 00:00:48,017
They'd ruled Egypt for nearly 300 years.

14
00:00:48,167 --> 00:00:52,417
She was reportedly the first of them to learn Egyptian.

15
00:00:52,567 --> 00:00:56,583
Ancient writers say she spoke about nine languages.

16
00:00:56,733 --> 00:01:00,617
Ancient Egypt lasted a very long time.

17
00:01:00,767 --> 00:01:03,983
Cleopatra was near the very end.

18
00:01:04,133 --> 00:01:08,483
Pyramid to Cleopatra: 2,500 years.

19
00:01:08,633 --> 00:01:12,650
And from Cleopatra to you: about 2,000.

20
00:01:12,800 --> 00:01:16,850
Anyway, here's Cleopatra building a pyramid.
